    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What would you do if you woke up in the afterlife?</strong><br><br>The hospital room she knew is gone. Beyond the window lies a blank, white void that stretches endlessly. Instead of the usual aches and pains, she awakens feeling better than she has in years. Is this a dream, or\u2026?<br><br><strong>Return to Ash</strong> is a narrative-driven visual novel focused on emotional storytelling and relationship building. Your decisions will shape Ashleigh\u2019s journey, and determine how her story ends.<br><br>Explore a mysterious afterlife, forge bonds with others trapped in this strange purgatory, and face impossible, torturous trials from a masked being who calls themself \u201cDeath\u201d.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445830/extras/341dcd286d4c9e3ee1934d396fe76ec0.avif?t=1752163901\" data-has-big width=800 height=842 /></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Visual Novel:</strong> Immerse yourself in an emotional story about life, death, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter:</strong> Build relationships with a cast of memorable characters, each with their own dreams, regrets, and reasons to return to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Art Style:</strong> A distinct and atmospheric visual design brings the afterlife and its mysteries to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Experience a beautiful, emotional score that complements every twist and turn of Ashleigh\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Impactful:</strong> A complete story experience with multiple endings, designed to be finished in 2-4 hours.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What would you do if you woke up in the afterlife?</strong><br><br>The hospital room she knew is gone. Beyond the window lies a blank, white void that stretches endlessly. Instead of the usual aches and pains, she awakens feeling better than she has in years. Is this a dream, or\u2026?<br><br><strong>Return to Ash</strong> is a narrative-driven visual novel focused on emotional storytelling and relationship building. Your decisions will shape Ashleigh\u2019s journey, and determine how her story ends.<br><br>Explore a mysterious afterlife, forge bonds with others trapped in this strange purgatory, and face impossible, torturous trials from a masked being who calls themself \u201cDeath\u201d.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445830/extras/341dcd286d4c9e3ee1934d396fe76ec0.avif?t=1752163901\" data-has-big width=800 height=842 /></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Visual Novel:</strong> Immerse yourself in an emotional story about life, death, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter:</strong> Build relationships with a cast of memorable characters, each with their own dreams, regrets, and reasons to return to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Art Style:</strong> A distinct and atmospheric visual design brings the afterlife and its mysteries to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Experience a beautiful, emotional score that complements every twist and turn of Ashleigh\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Impactful:</strong> A complete story experience with multiple endings, designed to be finished in 2-4 hours.</p></li></ul>",
